# VIGIL Server Patterns

- Export Zod schemas next to handlers; validate all inputs.
- Use typed errors (`VigilError`) with stable `code` strings.
- Journal writes are append-only — never UPDATE sealed why-cards.
- Paper executor must refuse when `BITGET_PAPER` is not true.
- Prefer composition: ingest → signal → policy → execute → seal.
